{"id":"437e16026e9e0691","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-finite-frame-rank.md","title":"Rank in a Finite GL Frame","display":"df-finite-frame-rank — Rank in a Finite GL Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-finite-frame-rank","aliases":["89-df-finite-frame-rank"],"display":"df-finite-frame-rank — Rank in a Finite GL Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-finite]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-finite-frame-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-finite-frame-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-frame-rank — Rank in a Finite GL Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0R\\cdots Rw_k\">\\(w_0R\\cdots Rw_k\\)</span> 表示长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的路径；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 允许仅 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0\">\\(w_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}frame\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\rho_F(w)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\{k\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\exists w_0,\\ldots,w_k\\in W\\ (w_0=w\\land\n\\forall i&lt;k\\ w_iRw_{i+1})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}frame\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\rho_F(w)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\{k\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\exists w_0,\\ldots,w_k\\in W\\ (w_0=w\\land\n\\forall i&lt;k\\ w_iRw_{i+1})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 7 章，印刷页 93–95；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n路径集合非空，包含 0；非自反且传递排除重复世界，故长度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|W|\">\\(|W|\\)</span>，最大值存在唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_F(w)&gt;\\rho_F(v)\">\\(\\rho_F(w)&gt;\\rho_F(v)\\)</span>；传递性保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&lt;\\rho_F(w)\">\\(m&lt;\\rho_F(w)\\)</span> 都在某后继世界实现。秩 0 即终端世界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"w_0R\\cdots Rw_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"w_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}frame\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\rho_F(w)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\{k\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\exists w_0,\\ldots,w_k\\in W\\ (w_0=w\\land\n\\forall i<k\\ w_iRw_{i+1})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"|W|","display":false},{"tex":"wRv","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_F(w)>\\rho_F(v)","display":false},{"tex":"m<\\rho_F(w)","display":false}],"bytes":1100,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab51daf02675e633","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"251691cede4cbc3e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8eb27a8b07c2dc2b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"16ae22435ebdf5f5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c2347bd841306e40","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a0b83ca065132609","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]] → [[89-df-finite-frame-rank]] → [[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]] → [[89-df-letterless-trace]] → [[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]] → [[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]] → [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","9cd755e57aea2c47"]}